DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260915T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260915T180000
UID:a752b298ebf8839b2c371840c4d6a613@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/PostcardPod%20Logo_20250624044140514105_20260810162111805547.
 png
DESCRIPTION:Join us to write postcards to voters across the country\, remi
 nding them of their essential super-power: voting! We work with campaigns 
 on both state and national level. We've written to elect judges\, council 
 members\, Senators\, Representatives\, Assemblypeople\, Governors. We are 
 working to preserve and protect democracy\, so we write mainly to Democrat
  or Independent voters. We have all the supplies\, just bring a favorite p
 en and $15 for the packet of 15 postcards\, stamps and instructions. We're
  a 
LOCATION:Aqus Café at Foundry Wharf\, 189 H St.\, Petaluma\, CA\, 94952
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/indivisiblesonomacounty/event/1007204/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Sonoma County (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
