SUMMARY:State of Play" Series with IndiMarin
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260916T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260916T180000
UID:1871095ce91c03aa8e9c9e13e0ef0803@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/organization/Mobilize%20Generalized%20Indivisible%20Event%20Campaig
 n%20Image%201_20231214173802957298.png
DESCRIPTION:This a local Indivisible event! Join IndiMarin for our monthly
  State of Play virtual call as we preview the electoral landscape for the 
 2026 Midterm election. Winning back control of Congress is critical to sav
 ing our democracy and ending the abuses of the Trump Administration. To do
  that\, we need to be informed about the electoral dynamics. Our electoral
  team will brief us on the issues and events that will decide this histori
 c election. Then\, we will share information on volunteer opportunitie
LOCATION:Virtual event
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/indivisible/event/961733/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Sonoma County (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:SLSF Phone Banks for the 2026 Midterm Elections
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260917T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260917T193000
UID:8118bedc39f112c4ea7638bcac67efdd@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/Mobilize%20Events%20%281200%20-%20630%20px%29%20%2889%29_2026
 0128042619672529.png
DESCRIPTION:Join us along with the Bay Area Coalition to contact voters ab
 out the 2026 Midterm Elections. We'll be using the state-of-the-art autodi
 aler Scale To Win. We'll employ deep canvassing techniques such as active 
 listening to open our 2026 voter conversations and learn which issues are 
 important to them. No experience required - we will train you how to do ev
 erything. Thursdays from 5:30 - 7:30 PM (PT). If you haven’t heard of it
 \, Swing Left is a national network that helps people find high impact 
LOCATION:Virtual event
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/swingleft/event/893165/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Sonoma County (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
