DESCRIPTION:Celebrate National Voter Registration Day with us at our visib
 ility event on September 15th from 11:00 a.m. - 12:00 p.m. at the corner o
 f College Ave. and Mendocino Ave. in Santa Rosa. At 12:00\, we'll walk to 
 the Santa Rosa Plaza where the League of Women Voters will be registering 
 voters inside Lush Cosmetics from 10-4! We’re committed to sustaining an
 d strengthening our democracy by visibly bringing attention to the vote on
  National Voter Registration Day. Bring your positive\, nonpartisan sign
LOCATION:College Avenue & Mendocino Avenue\, Santa Rosa\, CA\, 95404
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/indivisiblesonomacounty/event/1024738/
